  "job_B14.21_20251003_114306": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00d0is synd \u00f0a fri\u00f0mal & \u00f0a forword, \u00f0e \u00e6thelred cyng & ealle his witan wi\u00f0 \u00f0one here gedon habba\u00f0, \u00f0e \u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6rost, \u00fe\u00e6t woroldfri\u00f0 stande betweox \u00e6thelrede cynge & eallum his leodscipe & eallum \u00f0am here, & gif \u00e6nig sciphere on Englaland hergie, \u00fe\u00e6t we habban heora ealra fultum; & we him sculon mete & \u00e6lc \u00f0\u00e6ra landa \u00f0e \u00e6nigne fri\u00f0ige \u00f0\u00e6ra \u00f0e \u00e6nglaland hergie, beo hit utlah wi\u00f0 us & wi\u00f0 ealne here. & \u00e6lc ceapscip fri\u00f0 h\u00e6bbe, \u00f0e binnan mu\u00f0an cuman, \u00f0eh hit unfri\u00f0scyp sy, gyf hit undrifen bi\u00f0. & \u00f0eh hit gedriuen beo & hit \u00e6tfleo to hwilcre fri\u00f0byrig, & \u00f0a menn up \u00e6tberstan into \u00f0\u00e6re byrig, & \u00e6lc agenra fri\u00f0manna fri\u00f0 h\u00e6bbe, ge on lande ge on w\u00e6tere, ge binnan mu\u00f0an ge butan. Gyf \u00e6\u00f0elredes cynges fri\u00f0man cume on unfri\u00f0land, & se here \u00f0\u00e6rto cume, h\u00e6bbe fri\u00f0 his scip & ealle Gyf he his scip upp getogen h\u00e6bbe o\u00f0\u00f0on hulc geworhtne o\u00f0\u00f0on geteld geslagen: \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0\u00e6r fri\u00f0 Gyf he his \u00e6hta bere geman \u00f0ara unfri\u00f0manna \u00e6hta into huse, \u00f0olie his \u00e6hta & \u00e6bbe sylf fri\u00f0 & feorh, Gyf se fri\u00f0man fleo o\u00f0\u00f0on feohte & nelle hine cy\u00f0an: gif hine man ofslea, licge ungylde. Gyf man beo \ufffd",
